  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Private sector &amp; Peacebuilding Colombia 2023-2026</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">Privatsektorn &amp; fredsbyggande i Colombia 2023-2026</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="2">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Impact goal 
Providing concrete solutions to transform and improve the living conditions and opportunities of the population and territories affected by the armed conflict, thereby contributing to peace.

Outcomes:
1.Learn and innovate: which implies a raising awareness and knowledge strategy that includes collecting, systematizing and producing knowledge about business models and actions that contribute to peace and offer useful inputs to public and business decision-making. 
2.Inclusive business: which aims to include, as competitive suppliers, the productive organizations of vulnerable populations, located in conflict affected regions, in the value chain of anchor companies. 
3.Inspire: which aims to promote and visibilize the role of the business sector in peace building in Colombia.  The three pillars include activities at national and regional levels.</narrative>
  </description>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">Detta &#xe4;r ett gemensamt program utvecklat av Andi Foundation, Ideas for Peace Foundation och Emprender Paz Corporation f&#xf6;r att fr&#xe4;mja st&#xf6;rre engagemang fr&#xe5;n den privata sektorn i att tillhandah&#xe5;lla konkreta l&#xf6;sningar f&#xf6;r att f&#xf6;r&#xe4;ndra och f&#xf6;rb&#xe4;ttra levnadsvillkoren f&#xf6;r befolkningen och f&#xf6;r de territorier som p&#xe5;verkats av den v&#xe4;pnade konflikten, och d&#xe4;rmed bidra till fred. 

F&#xf6;rslaget syftar till att samordna de tre institutionernas anstr&#xe4;ngningar f&#xf6;r att fr&#xe4;mja ett integrerat tillv&#xe4;gag&#xe5;ngss&#xe4;tt som inkluderar input och information till beslutsfattare och allm&#xe4;nheten, bygger broar mellan nationella och regionala regeringar och f&#xf6;retag, &#xf6;kar medvetenheten bland privata f&#xf6;retag om goda exempel p&#xe5; ansvarsfullt f&#xf6;retagande och den p&#xe5;verkan de kan ha i fredsbyggandet, och slutligen, som fr&#xe4;mjar kommersiella f&#xf6;rbindelser mellan stora f&#xf6;retag och mindre b&#xf6;nder fr&#xe5;n konfliktdrabbade regioner och d&#xe4;rav stimulerar ekonomiska m&#xf6;jligheter i dessa regioner. Detta &#xe4;r en forts&#xe4;ttningsfas p&#xe5; Sida&#x2019;s insatser med ID-nummer: 55190013; 52060045; 55190020 och 10924</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">This is a project support developed by Andi Foundation, Ideas for Peace Foundation and Emprender Paz Corporation to promote greater involvement by the private sector in providing concrete solutions to transform and improve the living conditions of the population and territories affected by the armed conflict, thereby contributing to peace.

The contribution aims to coordinate efforts of the three organisations to promote an integral approach that includes inputs and information for policy makers as well as the public opinion, builds bridges between the national and regional governments and enterprises, raises awareness among private companies of good examples of responsible business conduct together with the impact they could play in peace building, and, finally, promotes commercial links between large companies and small peasant farmers from conflict affected regions thus stimulating economic opportunities in selected regions.  

This is a continuation phase of Sida&#x2019;s contributions with ID-numbers: 55190013, 52060045, 55190020 and 10924.</narrative>
  </description>
